        'faq' => [
            ['Do I need to know anything about tech?', 'No. You tell me how your business works and I handle the rest. I\'ll only show you what you\'ll use, in plain language.'],
            ['How long does it take?', 'A digital card takes 2 days, a digital menu 3, a landing page 3 business days (free preview within 24 business hours) and a website 7 to 10 days. Bigger projects are delivered in weekly milestones.'],
            ['How does payment work?', 'You get a fixed price before we start. Usually half upfront and half on delivery, or by milestone for larger projects. Payment by card, PayPal, Wise or bank transfer.'],
            ['Will I own the website and domain?', 'Yes. Everything I build is yours: domain, content and access.'],
            ['You\'re in Brazil. Does that work for me?', 'Yes. I worked for over two years with a team in Germany. We talk by WhatsApp, email or video call, in English, and I overlap with US and European business hours.'],
            ['What if I need help later?', 'Every project includes 30 days of free tweaks. After that, you can stay on a care plan or just reach out when you need something.'],
