            'stats' => [['8 years', 'building software'], ['Complete systems', 'from database to screen'], ['Preview in 24h', 'without paying anything'], ['One person', 'from first message to delivery']], 'pledges' => [['Preview before you pay', 'Within 24 business hours you see how your page could look. Like it, we go on. Do not, you pay nothing.'], ['Fixed price in writing', 'You know the total before we start. No surprises halfway.'], ['You approve before launch', 'Nothing goes live without your OK. I adjust until it feels right.'], ['One person', 'No account managers, no hand-offs. The person talking to you writes the code.'], ['Plain language', 'I explain what you need to know, without jargon or fluff.'], ['30 days of free tweaks', 'After launch I adjust text, images and fixes for 30 days.']], 'story' => ['I spent years delivering for large companies, where deadlines and quality are not negotiable: campaigns with a fixed event date, systems the whole company uses every day.', 'What I learned there is what many small businesses never get: a clear process, delivery on time and someone who answers. I want the clinic, the salon and the office on your street to get the same care.', 'That is why everything starts with a conversation and a preview, and ends with you knowing how to use what you received.'], 'built' => [['prumo-card', 'Prumo', 'My personal finance app, with a plumb line, month-end forecast and an AI advisor.', '/prumo/', 'Open'], ['ex-prod-cardapio', 'Ready-made Digital Menu', 'A template so orders arrive ready on WhatsApp. One payment, no monthly fee.', '/produtos/cardapio/', 'See'], ['ex-prod-agenda', 'Ready-made Online Booking', 'A template for salons, barbers and beauty studios: clients pick their own slot.', '/produtos/agenda/', 'See']], 'steps' => [['A 15-minute chat', 'You tell me about the business. I listen and say what makes sense, without pushing what you do not need.'], ['Preview in 24 business hours', 'You see how it looks. You pay nothing.'], ['Fixed price in writing', 'Price, timeline and what is included. Only then do you decide.'], ['You approve and I publish', 'And I stay around for 30 days to tweak.']],
            'timeline_eyebrow' => 'Career', 'timeline_h2' => 'Where I\'ve worked',
